{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>去哈薩克行山唔一定要報團，今次選擇唔跟Tour、唔包車點到點打卡，改同旅途認識嘅朋友組隊，挑戰直上海拔約2,500米的大阿拉木圖湖（Big Almaty Lake）。\n</p>\n<p>路線本來有車路可上，但同行伙伴選擇了水管捷徑，一行人由市區搭車到遊客中心後，沿為阿拉木圖輸送食水嘅巨型管道上山，初段有鐵梯可以級級上，中後段連樓梯都冇，要拉住旁邊鋼索借力頂硬上。 捱過約1個鐘又斜又跣嘅大水管路段，再接平路行足約3小時終於抵達湖邊觀景台，眼前被雪山包圍嘅藍綠色湖水相當開揚。不過落山體感比上山更危險，建議想挑戰嘅朋友必穿防滑行山鞋、預先下載離線地圖，並盡量早上7至8點出發、自備充足水同糧食，避免摸黑落山。</p>\n<p>📍大阿拉木圖湖（Big Almaty Lake，Алматы, Kazakhstan）\n</p>\n<p>🥾單程約7公里（上山約需3小時，具一定斜度）</p>\n<p>好動旅人 ｜ 旅遊不止食買玩，用跑步、潛水或滑雪等活動探索世界，在運動的節奏裡，發現每個地方最真實的風景。邊一場戶外旅程令你最難忘？即刻DM我哋分享你的冒險故事！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179517605001157175_133032326b003672957ea.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179517605001157175_133032326b003672957ea.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：@nhmtheveggies)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Df9Ykc_TEz2/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IG精選</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%b8%ad%e4%ba%9e%e6%97%85%e9%81%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">中亞旅遊</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%93%88%e8%96%a9%e5%85%8b/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">哈薩克</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%b5%b7%e5%a4%96%e8%a1%8c%e5%b1%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">海外行山</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：@nhmtheveggies資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Df9Ykc_TEz2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gotrip IG</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 20 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T12:23:59.183095+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":604,"images":1,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T12:00:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T12:17:24.308150+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T12:17:24.308150+00:00","content_hash":"6f6e9b3e6169c74978ad80f4f5fb1c3ae455c6adca33122e6694f3002a0a5f8d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}